{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_mostma_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_mostma_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"旅途的註腳","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_mostma_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"415bdd2b379b5251d95e713f4eb24e161fe0d0af75ffb1a5778d8fe781b1f86e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"五年前，一場天災，將我們的深根鎮毀於一旦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了聖城使者的援手，我們才得以在這片新的土地上重新繁衍生息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"五年過去了，現在，新的深根鎮已經有模有樣了，我們也終於能夠抽出時間重振深根鎮的傳統藝術——雕塑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經的深根鎮中央總是擺放著我們技術最好的工匠的作品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我希望重拾這種傳統，由我們如今技術最好的工匠雕刻一座雕像，用這座雕像，祭奠那些在天災中罹難的鎮民們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇珊，你的父親生前是鎮上最好的工匠，這幾年你的努力大家也看在眼裡，你願意接下這份工作嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我——如果父親沒有被天災……他一定有辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"但……我不知道現在的自己能不能做得到，我也不知道自己是不是準備好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"紀念那些逝去的人，這太沉重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，這對你來說是一個艱巨的挑戰，只是，現在鎮上已經沒有其他人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然蘇珊沒有把握，可以讓我試試看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"梅麗莎？！你、你怎麼從拉特蘭回來了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您給我的信中提到鎮裡打算重新建立一座雕像，我就立刻啟程出發了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我當時跟著使者回到了聖城，但是，我始終仍把自己當作深根鎮的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，你想來負責雕像的雕刻，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，回到拉特蘭後，我開始鑽研雕刻技術，一直等待著能夠重新為鎮上出一份力的這天到來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"難為你有這個心了，既然這樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"在小鎮被毀滅前，豎立在小鎮中央的那座雕像，就是我父親的傑作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"那座雕像……很特殊，鎮上的每個人都說，靠近那座雕像後就能聞到專屬於這座小鎮的氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得……還原那座雕像，才是祭奠他們的最好方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你能還原那種氣味嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我不確定，但是，我想試試看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽好了，蘇珊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮上剩下的人，不會永遠等著你找回“特殊”的傳統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有時候，延續本身更重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"……我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）父親以前常去的地方……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）雖然危險，但是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，蘇珊，你要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她去的方向……嘖，說得太過火了嗎，我去把她拉回來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇珊就交給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——莫斯提馬小姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見了，鎮長，還有梅麗莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩隊長和其他人最近還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呵呵，他們都很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後再聊吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問是梅麗莎小姐嗎？啊，一定是你沒錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把你雕刻需要用的材料都送過來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，請問你見過一個叫莫斯提馬的薩科塔嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲）……莫斯提馬，你是特地選這個時間過來的嗎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以莫斯提馬去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她剛剛上山了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕短時間內回不來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦——好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先來幫你的忙吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就這麼接受了她丟給你的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直在找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一次到一個新的地方，我都會像這樣碰巧遇到一些和找她一樣有趣的事可以做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來她是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，但是莫斯提馬從以前開始就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小的時候，我每次找她去搞爆炸，她都不會陪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是有好幾次，我發現，她其實一直都在遠處看著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你又是怎麼認識莫斯提馬的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五年前，我們曾經的小鎮——深根鎮被天災毀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我的父親是唯二倖存的薩科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖城接到父親的求援，派了一支小隊過來接我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那支小隊，就是姐姐曾經所在的小隊……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，他們的隊長安多恩沒有直接帶我們走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他帶著隊友，把其他倖存下來的、不是薩科塔的難民，護送到了現在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還為他們向聖城申請了物資——我後來才知道，他們全隊預支了一整年的薪水，扛下了這件事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算一下時間，小樂現在應該已經在梅麗莎那裡開始工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅麗莎瞭解的過去，或許可以稍微滿足一些她的好奇心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到你了，蘇珊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就是父親以前經常來的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"從這裡，可以眺望整座小鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"每當他心情不好的時候，他就會來這裡，遠遠看著小鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"他常說，真正的銘記不是留下訊息，而是讓觸摸雕像的人能想起舊日的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——父親，現在，我站在這裡只能看到一片廢墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那座雕像，看起來還沒有完全損壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去去就回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g4_mini12_village"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，這塊石頭真的好大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是製作一個雕像要用的石頭吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。我從一開始就想好了，我想要做一組雕像，用來紀念那些逝去的人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在拉特蘭也看過一整組類似的雕像吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——你是說廣場上那種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我想雕刻一組那樣的雕像，然後，將所有罹難者的名字都收集起來刻在上面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來就像教堂裡的那些壁畫一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聰明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。你剛才說，你是回到拉特蘭後才開始學雕塑的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，雖說深根鎮曾經以雕塑聞名，但也不是每個人都喜歡雕塑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是其中之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老實說，我不太適應拉特蘭的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是早就習慣在深根鎮的生活，我不太能接受拉特蘭那種特別歡快的氣氛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——我能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是這兩年追著莫斯提馬到處跑的原因吧，我見到了很多拉特蘭之外的風景，也知道有許多地方其實和拉特蘭是不一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎？我現在的願望之一，就是找一座新的城市生活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你只是單純的樂天派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，回到拉特蘭後，我反而開始對雕塑感興趣，還下定決心從頭開始學習雕塑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心裡想著，有一天，我會回到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——拉特蘭的雕塑，和這裡的雕塑不一樣吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我當然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我從頭開始學習雕塑之後，我就沒有一天不後悔——我應該趁原來的深根鎮還在的時候，學習那裡的雕塑技巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是事已至此，我情願用拉特蘭的技術來延續這裡的傳統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非有人能找到更好的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，你其實希望蘇珊能做到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……開玩笑，我才不希望自己這五年的刻苦學習白費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這塊最大的石頭，放這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，既然你要幫忙的話，就先從把石頭切割成我要的大小開始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，用拉特蘭的方法來說，就是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爆破！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我就知道。你只要別把它變成一堆粉末就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，畢竟我是爆破高手！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_y"},{"type":"narration","text":"街道早已被歲月沖刷得面目全非、泥濘不堪，四處散落著磚塊和瓦礫，放眼望去，處處都是天災留下的痕跡。\n即使是最有經驗的信使，也會選擇小心翼翼地繞開這樣危險的地方，但莫斯提馬只是將帽簷向下壓了壓，就毫不猶豫地踏入其中。\n短短兩年時間，她對這樣的環境早已習以為常。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"如果是五年前的自己，恐怕此時並不會多此一舉，不如說，她甚至不會站在這裡，她想。\n但是，這兩年，作為萬國信使，她踏過了太多前所未見的土地，見過了太多聞所未聞的軼事。\n在踏足這片區域時，她對蘇珊的話已經隱約有了一些猜測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那種氣味的答案，或許很簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吧，看來你也這麼想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫斯提馬輕快地來到廢墟中央的雕像前，小心地從雕像上取下一片殘留的外殼，聞了聞。\n隨後，她又蹲下挖起一抔土壤，聞了聞。\n和她想的一樣。\n所謂“小鎮的氣味”，它的秘方並不複雜——\n它只是這片土地的土壤和雕塑用的石材混合後散發出的味道。\n讓鎮民們感到親切的原因也很簡單，它既有這一帶植被留在土壤裡的清新氣息，又有石材本身獨特的礦物味。\n兩者都是鎮民們最常聞到的氣息，將它們混合起來，就成了專屬於生活在這片土地上的人所懷念的氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說真的，不是什麼好聞的氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過……我們走過了那麼多的地方，這種氣味確實很獨特，對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了——炸藥安裝完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據我的精準計算，它炸開後，一定可以達成你想要的結果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……看不出來，你還真的是這方面的專家呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻，我說過了，我是爆破高手嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就開始吧，我按！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蕾繆樂的計算確實十分準確。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著幾聲爆破聲，巨大的石頭恰如其分地裂成了幾塊。\n唯一的問題是——她忘了石頭的材質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，忘記提醒你了，這種石頭爆破後會產生大量的粉塵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鋪天蓋地的粉塵籠罩了蕾繆樂，讓她一時間睜不開眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哇哇，我什麼也看不到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，這是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我睜不開眼睛了，梅麗莎，快點來扶我一下啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，小心！那邊有坑——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？哇啊——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"蕾繆樂感覺到自己腳一扭，身體瞬間失去平衡，眼看就要摔進旁邊的坑洞裡——\n但就在這時，一隻手抓住了她的手臂，將她拉了回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅麗莎，謝謝你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小樂，你要小心一點才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？莫斯提馬？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"聽到那個熟悉的聲音，她立刻用力揉了揉眼睛，努力睜開了雙眼。\n然而，眼前空無一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳咳呸呸呸，莫斯提馬？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梅麗莎，剛才莫斯提馬來過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？怎麼連梅麗莎也不見了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1810_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這到底是怎麼回事啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這個氣味……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，就是這個氣味……唔哦哦……嗚嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是過去的深根鎮的氣味啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……確實是那種氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到它的原理竟然這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越是簡單的東西，反而越容易被銘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不得不謝謝你們找回它，莫斯提馬、蘇珊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"……我才要謝謝你，梅麗莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有你，或許我會一直在原地打轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哼，別高興得太早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這種氣味的原理這麼簡單，那我為什麼不能用這個呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很卑鄙嘛，梅麗莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇珊，你不會以為自己找到了那股氣味，鎮民們就會選擇你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我會雕刻出最好的雕像的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樸實的鎮長","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我真不知道該怎麼感謝你，莫斯提馬，你為小鎮找回了熟悉的氣味，又為小鎮注入了活力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您太誇張了，鎮長，這一切……都和我沒有必然的關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我確實有點好奇，莫斯提馬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五年前，你跟在那位安多恩隊長的後面一言不發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼今天，忽然跑來為我們做這些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_5"},{"type":"narration","text":"當她趕到現場的時候，看到的是狂亂的安多恩重傷了蕾繆安。\n在那一瞬間，她捕捉到了許多情緒——有困惑、狂躁，也有釋然、包容。\n這讓她心生疑惑，但並沒有妨礙她的行動。\n為了阻止安多恩，她最終只能使用守護銃，將鎖與匙從他手中打落，並在奪取鎖與匙後，帶著蕾繆安離開。\n在菲亞梅塔的陪同下，她們一起回到了拉特蘭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g8_laterano_dwelling"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨後，鎖與匙被收回，她也遭到了軟禁。\n對於墮天，她完全沒有後悔過。更讓她在意的，始終是安多恩究竟在鎖與匙之中看到了什麼。\n於是，她作出了一個大膽的決定——硬闖教皇廳。\n畢竟錯過這次機會後，她恐怕再也沒有機會探明這個秘密。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g2_laterano_cathedralhall"},{"type":"narration","text":"闖入教皇廳並不是那麼容易的事，不過她最終還是成功了——\n當然，現在想想，這顯然是那位白鬍子老頭有意為之。不然的話，他也不會將鎖與匙交給她來保管。\n無論如何，她再次見到了鎖與匙。\n當她從安多恩手中將其奪下時，雙杖並沒有對她作出反應。\n而這一次，當她帶著疑問再次觸碰雙杖時，她走入了一片幻境之中。\n在那裡，她看到了——\n過去的縫隙。未來的斷面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老實說，她對於安多恩看到了什麼有大概的猜測。\n而在幻境中見到那些景象後，她立刻理解了，為什麼安多恩會陷入癲狂。\n畢竟，那是永遠對未來憂心忡忡、永遠會為一個十分微小的悲劇而扼腕嘆息的安多恩。\n某種意義上，她甚至可以說，菲亞梅塔對安多恩的作為如此憤怒，恰恰是源自菲亞梅塔對過去的他的認可——\n很顯然，對於心懷正義的菲亞梅塔而言，悲天憫人的安多恩，確實比總是游離於事態之外的她更值得認可。\n但對莫斯提馬而言，她並不執著於安多恩為何陷入狂亂，這不單純是因為當時她從那兩人身上捕捉到的情緒。\n更多的是因為，她從一開始——或許是加入安多恩的小隊，甚至是見到安多恩的那一瞬間，就已經隱約有一種感覺——\n安多恩走在和她完全相反的道路上，他遲早會和自己分道揚鑣。\n就像那時，眼前是萬千的碎片，每一塊碎片都可能預示著一個問題的答案，或許窮盡所有的碎片，終極問題的答案也將自然而然浮現。\n安多恩必然會毫不猶豫地選擇走向那些碎片，踏入那片閃爍著繁星的漆黑沼澤。\n而她——選擇了回頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次，看到那幅光景的時候，我在想——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，真慘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除此之外，我無法產生更多的感想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以至於我並不能理解某人當時的掙扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"猶豫的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬姐姐，你的角，你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"穩重的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你墮天了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩年，作為萬國信使，我一直在外面旅行，最後，我得出了一個結論——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，朋友，薩科塔真是一群可愛的混帳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在瞭解自己是個混帳之後……重新學著和這片大地相處罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，記得幫我告訴小樂，我接到了新的任務，下一站要去龍門待一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛好，半年前在旅途中遇到過一個叫大帝的傢伙，他也在龍門，可以去拜訪他一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"narration","text":"走到山坡上，莫斯提馬轉身回頭。\n從這裡，隱約能夠看到廣場上發生的事。\n廣場上，蘇珊和梅麗莎已經各自開始了準備，越來越多的人被二人的行為吸引，在廣場上聚集起來。\n在所有人之中，有一個紅髮薩科塔特別顯眼，她在兩邊走來走去，這邊幫一下，那邊幫一下，彷彿忘了自己的初衷。\n莫斯提馬難得沒有戴起帽兜，任由微風拂過她的臉頰，吹起她的髮梢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
